id: durable
name: Durable
kind: crafting
slots: 1
# "This piece of Apparel does not have the Lightweight Apparel Quality" - a Prerequisite about
# the piece, not the wearer: with Lightweight on it, Durable does not apply at all.
excludesQualities: lightweight
prerequisites: This piece of Apparel does not have the Lightweight Apparel Quality
# "Increase the maximum Break Value for this piece of Apparel by 3."
breakValue: 3
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Maximum Break Value 3 higher. Not with Lightweight on the same piece.
# What it does, for the Effects on its Item's sheet: one line to an effect, each opening with
# its tag as the rulebook writes one - [Passive], [Automatic, 1/Encounter].
summary: >
  [Passive]: Maximum Break Value 3 higher.
text: >
  Durable: This particular piece of apparel is extremely hard to damage.
  –Apparel Category: All
  –Prerequisites: This piece of Apparel does not have the Lightweight Apparel Quality
  –Quality Slots: 1
  –Effects: Increase the maximum Break Value for this piece of Apparel by 3.

---

# The piece's own: its sheet shows the most its Break Value can be, 6 with this. Losing Break
# Value and repairing it come with the rest of the Apparel rules, and read that most.
